{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNOfflinePack","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pack","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^)("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSError"},{"kind":"text","text":" *"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":""},{"kind":"text","text":")) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"pack","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The offline pack to be invalidated.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"completion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The completion handler to call once the pack has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"marked for revalidation in offline storage, or an error occurs. This handler is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executed asynchronously on the main queue.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is more efficient than deleting the offline pack and downloading it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again. If the data stored locally matches that on the server, new data will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be downloaded.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:"}],"title":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Invalidates the specified offline pack. This method checks that the tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the specified offline pack match those from the server. Local tiles that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do not match the latest version on the server are updated.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/invalidatepack:withcompletionhandler:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage","abstract":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNOfflineStorage","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/invalidatepack:withcompletionhandler:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Invalidates the specified offline pack. This method checks that the tiles"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the specified offline pack match those from the server. Local tiles that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do not match the latest version on the server are updated.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" represents